  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 5
  storyText: "From our balcony, we can see the other dormitory building. Two floors
    below are university students like us. Three floors above are high school kids.
    Lucky them \u2014 they all went home to their parents before this started. We
    weren't so lucky. We stayed. For exams. For cheap instant noodles. For nothing.
    Now their windows are dark. Their rooms are empty. We hope they're safe with
    their families. We hope their families are safe. We try not to think about what
    \"safe\" even means anymore."
